cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ralph: a parametrizable loop runner for AI coding CLIs"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Bash / PowerShell wrapper that runs an AI coding CLI
  (Codex, Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Devin) in a loop, starting a fresh LLM agent
  session on every iteration and feeding it the same prompt, for long unattended
  "keep working until it's done" runs.
type: software
authors:
